2 Graphical Abstract 1T-MoS 2/O-g-C3N4 2D hetero structure  shows the highest external quantum efficiency (~7.11%, λ= 420 nm ) in all  g-C3N4-based photoca talysts using Pt -free co -catalyst , and t he TOF is the highest compare with the all Pt -g-C3N4, excepted for the single atoms P t Highlights  1. Developing new materials for  photocatalytic H 2 evolution , like  1T-MoS 2/O-g-C3N4 2D hetero structures .  2. A few 1T -MoS 2 can significantly improve the photocatalytic H 2 evolution activity of O - g-C3N4.  3. The activity  of 2D hetero structures far exceeds the performance using Pt as co - catalyst at low content.  4. 1T-MoS 2/O-g-C3N4 2D hetero structure  shows the high external quantum efficiency and TOF. Abstract:
