s identiﬁed as a kind ofpromising strategy because of the high density of atomic steps and low-coordinated atoms, which can provide much more active sites [ 81–83]. Moreover, the combination with other elements and the modiﬁcation of phase interface can further improve catalytic performance and structural sta- bility [ 30], which allows PGMs-based electrocatalysts with HIFs widely applied in the common anode catalytic reaction. Fig. 9 a Scheme for synthesizing THH particles; b–cTEM image and ideal model of THH Pt particle recorded along [001] direction; dHRTEM image recorded from boxed area in bandean atomic model of (210) facet. Reproduced with permission from Ref. [ 66]. Copyright 2019, Science 1 Rare Met.A review of energy and environment electrocatalysis based on high-index faceted nanocrystals
