s good for increased current density, but as that surface was then treated with chemical pickling, the acid attack smoothened the grooves and channels and decreased the surface area, thus removing any advantage gained by machining. Fig. 16.SEM images of (a) SSM, (b) SSM-Ni, and (c) SSM-Ni-P samples. (d) EDX spectrum of SSM-Ni-P (e–j) EDS elemental mapping of SSM-Ni-P sample [170]. Fig. 17.Nyquist plots for OER of SSM, SSM-Ni and SSM-Ni-P as electro - catalysts [170]. A. Raza et al.
