also worth noting that the neighboring P atom at  the <Pt-Pd-Pd-2> site s in the Pt5Pd3P2 nanocrystals enhance d the H* adsorption/desorption ability, suggesting  that the Pd and Pt  atoms in catalytic sites neighboring with P solute were  favorable for the enhancement  of HER kinetics . The neighboring effect  of P atoms  was more significant for the Pt atoms  than for the Pd atoms  (Figure S20 with the corresponding  discussion). In addition,  the interaction between Pt and H* was much stronger than that between Pd and H* both in the Pt3Pd2 and Pt 5Pd3P2 nanocrystals (Figure S21 with the corresponding discussion ). Consequently, the Pt 5Pd3P2 nanocrystals in the nano sponge -like ligaments of the dealloyed HEMG with a large number of active sites achieving  superior  ΔGH*
