n PtH-A4 (Fig. 2f). The inset in fi g. 2 e and f, accurately illustrates the shape 26 represented by both nanostructures of PtH-A2 and Pt H-A4.  27 The different structures obtained from the PtHSs su ggest that the type of Pt precursor (oil soluble 28 or water soluble) had a direct effect on the morpho logy of the products obtained.  The 29
