rence Fe 3C spectrum (Figure S9), consistent with t he presence of an iron fraction in a higher oxidation state and coordinated by light atoms (C, N, or O). According to the presence of single atoms in HAADF -STEM images, this higher oxidation state appears to be related to the presence of Fe -N4 species throughout the carbon
