.49 V, NiFeP: 0.69 V, NiCoP: 0.53 V, Ni2P: 0.71 V) in alkaline medium was ascribed to the optimized electron filling by doped Mo. A simple electrodeposition Fig. 12.Modification strategy for transition metal carbides electrocatalysts. a. Schematic fabrication for Ni-Ni 3C/CC electrocatalysts. b. TEM of Ni-Ni 3C. c. Gibbs free-energy of hydrogen adsorption [157] . d. Schematic fabrication for Mo-WC@NCS. e. Calculated partial DOSs, W atom in WC (001) and Mo-WC (001). f. Gibbs free energy for hydrogen adsorption [158] . Copyright 2020, John Wiley & Sons, and Copyright 2020, Elsevier. Reproduced with permission from ref [157][158] C. Wang et al.
