ized by a one-pot reflux assisted Fig. 14.Representative studies for 0D and 1D carbon-based electrocatalysts. a. Synthesis process of F/BCN nanohybrids. b. C 1 s spectra. c. LSVs of HER. d. Tafel plots. e. The Gibbs free energy (ΔGH*). f. Volcano plots [177] . g. Preparation of nitrogen-doped CQDs. h. The AFM image and i. TEM image of N-CQDs [181] . j. Synthesis procedure for CNT@NPC. k. The free energy (ΔGH*) diagrams for the HER [192] . Copyright 2021, ACS, Copyright 2021, Elsevier, and Copyright 2019, RSC. Reproduced with permission from ref [177][181][192] C. Wang et al.
